@startuml
[*] --> StartTriage
StartTriage -> AskChiefComplaint : Chief Complaint?
AskChiefComplaint -> CriticalSymptoms : Identify Critical Symptoms
CriticalSymptoms -> ImmediateTreatment : Critical Symptoms Present
CriticalSymptoms --> PriorityAssessment : No Critical Symptoms
ImmediateTreatment --> [*]
PriorityAssessment -> TimeSensitive : Time-Sensitive Issue?
TimeSensitive -> UrgentTreatment : Yes
TimeSensitive --> RoutineAssessment : No
UrgentTreatment --> [*]
RoutineAssessment -> PainEvaluation : Assess Pain Level
PainEvaluation -> RoutineTreatment : Manageable Pain
PainEvaluation -> PriorityTreatment : Severe Pain
RoutineTreatment --> [*]
PriorityTreatment --> [*]
@enduml